<body>
<div class="wrap">
<div class="title">🎤 EEME30001 · Real‑Time Waveform/Spectrum <small>Yuewen Xu · UoB · 2025 TB‑1 · Naim Dahnoun</small>
</div>
<div class="bar"><label>Time Window:</label> <select id="windowSel"> <option value="0.001">
1 ms</option> <option value="0.002">2 ms</option> <option value="0.005">5 ms</option>
<option value="0.010">10 ms</option> <option value="0.020">20 ms</option> <option value="0.050" selected="">
50 ms</option> <option value="0.100">100 ms</option> <option value="0.200">200 ms
</option> <option value="0.500">500 ms</option> <option value="1.0">1 s</option> <option value="2.0">
2 s</option> <option value="5.0">5 s</option> </select> <label>Y Scale:</label> <select id="yScaleSel">
<option value="auto" selected="">Auto</option> <option value="0.25">±0.25</option>
<option value="0.5">±0.5</option> <option value="1">±1</option> <option value="2">
±2</option> <option value="5">±5</option> </select><button id="btnStart" class="primary">
Start</button><button id="btnPause" disabled="">Pause</button><button id="btnStop" disabled="">
Stop</button> <span id="status" class="meta">Not Started</span> </div>
<div class="bar"><button id="btnTrigger" class="trigger" disabled="">Trigger: OFF
</button> <label>Mode:</label> <select id="triggerMode" disabled=""> <option value="auto" selected="">
Auto</option> <option value="rising">Rising Edge</option> <option value="falling">
Falling Edge</option> </select> <label>Level:</label> <input id="triggerLevel" type="number" value="0" disabled="" style="width:80px">
<label>Position:</label> <select id="triggerPos" disabled=""> <option value="0.1">
10%</option> <option value="0.2" selected="">20%</option> <option value="0.3">30%
</option> <option value="0.5">50%</option> </select> <span id="triggerStatus" class="meta trigger-info">
</span></div>
<div class="grid">
<div class="card">
<div id="timePlot" style="width:100%; height:360px"></div>
</div>
<div class="card">
<div id="freqPlot" style="width:100%; height:360px"></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="footer">Note: Runs fully in the browser using <code>Web Audio API</code> for microphone input and Plotly for plotting.<br>
Microphone access requires an HTTPS environment (e.g., GitHub Pages).<br>
<strong>Trigger Usage:</strong> Click &quot;Trigger: OFF&quot; to enable. Set Mode (Rising/Falling), adjust Level threshold, and Position (where trigger point appears in window).<br>
The red line shows the trigger level. Position controls pre-trigger data (e.g., 20% = trigger at 20% of window).<br>
For measuring PWM via headphone/line cable to a board: use AC coupling and attenuation to protect your audio input.
</div>
<div class="meta" id="info"></div>
</div>
